on exitFrame
  [  0] pushcons 0 .............................. <"start">
  [  2] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"start">
  [  4] extcall 64 .............................. puppetSound("start")
  [  6] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  8] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [ 10] extcall 80 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [ 12] jmpifz [ 23] ............................ if soundBusy(1) then
  [ 15] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 17] thebuiltin 86 ........................... <the frame>
  [ 19] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame>
  [ 21] extcall 70 .............................. go(the frame)
  [ 23] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 25] pushint8 100 ............................ <100>
  [ 27] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 29] set 4 ................................... set the volume of sound 2 to 100
  [ 31] pushcons 8 .............................. <"gameloop">
  [ 33] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"gameloop">
  [ 35] extcall 70 .............................. go("gameloop")
  [ 37] ret
end
